.TH man 1 "2026-06-08" "0.18.2" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
/outtype

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Send typing notifications, chat states (/states) will be enabled if this setting is enabled.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
/outtype on|off

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBon|off\fR
.RS 4
Enable or disable sending typing notifications.
.RE
